1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,087
A game about maids driving a drifting tank
is translated into thirty-one languages.

2
00:00:05,337 --> 00:00:06,584
Thirty-one.

3
00:00:08,834 --> 00:00:17,448
Maid Supremacy. Your maids take a tank with bolt-on weapons into battle to prove,
and I'm quoting the store page, that maids are better.

4
00:00:17,698 --> 00:00:21,819
You can play it alone, online,
or split-screen on one couch.

5
00:00:22,069 --> 00:00:27,809
And it ships for Windows, Mac and Linux.
The Linux build is the biggest of the three, just over a gigabyte.

6
00:00:28,209 --> 00:00:31,206
Worth a dip. It knows exactly what it is.

7
00:00:31,606 --> 00:00:35,074
That's Demo Dip.
A new Steam demo, every day.
